  "sourceReview": "A is the clean tree of main 0fffe021 (git tree 257b8828), B is the clean tree of 6a8c9d97 (git tree b263cbbb), both recomputed from git; patch and untracked manifests are the empty digests; B differs from A by exactly the PRF-01 candidate commit (src/tests/seam inventory; the src/tests/scripts/ARCHITECTURE diff hash equals that of the previously verified candidate commit 856580e7); the harness digest map is identical in A and B and equal to the runner tree.",
  "binaryReview": "sha256 of all twelve retained binaries recomputed outside the runner and equal to the capture receipts and linkage; features and cfg per role match the frozen role table; C0 is the A source built under an equal-length alternative path label.",
  "boundaryReview": "nm shows exactly one definition of producer_free_window and objdump exactly one direct call site in each of A/B/C0 primary and control binaries; every control symbol is a single ret followed by int3 padding, every primary symbol is the full remote-free loop.",
  "pathReview": "arm roots have identical length; run is to start from the A arm; no inherited compiler/cargo/iai override beyond what the runner rejects."
